      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The logical pushback often comes from redefining what constitutes \"value\" outside of thermodynamic efficiency. While physically inefficient in the grand cosmic scheme, the processes contained within our localized systems allow for complexity, growth, and subjective experience, which are valuable frameworks for life. Instead of viewing resistance as pointless striving, consider it as the demonstration of emergent patterns—the universe briefly creating something *new* before things settle.",
      "source": "target",
